e se zn\u011bn\u00ed z iSport \u2192 Nastaven\u00ed."],"Link":["Odkaz"],"Link text":["Text odkazu"],"Links to":["Odkazuje na"],"Name":["N\u00e1zev"],"None":["\u017d\u00e1dn\u00e9"],"Nowhere":["Nikam"],"Numbered":["\u010c\u00edslovan\u00e9"],"Open in a new window":["Otev\u0159\u00edt v nov\u00e9m okn\u011b"],"Order by":["\u0158adit podle"],"Picture":["Obr\u00e1zek"],"Places free":["Voln\u00e1 m\u00edsta"],"Price":["Cena"],"Round":["Kulat\u00e9"],"Show a heading":["Zobrazit nadpis"],"Size":["Velikost"],"Source":["Zdroj"],"Square":["\u010ctvercov\u00e9"],"Table cell":["Bu\u0148ka tabulky"],"Table heading":["Hlavi\u010dka tabulky"],"Table link":["Odkaz v tabulce"],"The one this page is about":["Ten, o kter\u00e9m tahle str\u00e1nka je"],"The picture at full size":["Obr\u00e1zek v pln\u00e9 velikosti"],"This field is empty for this record, so it will not appear on the page.":["Tohle pole je u tohoto z\u00e1znamu pr\u00e1zdn\u00e9, na str\u00e1nce se tedy neobjev\u00ed."],"Value element":["Prvek hodnoty"],"Value text":["Text hodnoty"],"What the column is called and what each link says. Left empty, the name the column comes with.":["Jak se sloupec jmenuje a co \u0159\u00edk\u00e1 ka\u017ed\u00fd odkaz. Kdy\u017e nech\u00e1te pr\u00e1zdn\u00e9, n\u00e1zev, se kter\u00fdm sloupec p\u0159ich\u00e1z\u00ed."],"What the picture says to somebody who cannot see it. Empty means the name of the course or trainer, which is usually right.":["Co obr\u00e1zek \u0159\u00edk\u00e1 tomu, kdo ho nevid\u00ed. Pr\u00e1zdn\u00e9 znamen\u00e1 n\u00e1zev kurzu nebo jm\u00e9no tren\u00e9ra, co\u017e b\u00fdv\u00e1 spr\u00e1vn\u011b."],"When it starts":["Podle za\u010d\u00e1tku"],"When there is nothing to show":["Kdy\u017e nen\u00ed co zobrazit"],"Where this column sits, counting from one. Nought leaves it out.":["Kolik\u00e1t\u00fd je tenhle sloupec, po\u010d\u00edt\u00e1no od jedn\u00e9. Nula ho vynech\u00e1."],"Which courses":["Kter\u00e9 kurzy"],"Which way":["Kter\u00fdm sm\u011brem"],"Who the course is for":["Pro koho kurz je"],"Wording of the details link":["Text odkazu na detail"],"As the theme says":["Podle \u0161ablony webu"],"Between items":["Mezi polo\u017ekami"],"Content":["Obsah"],"How far the list sits from the left \u2014 1.5em, 24px.":["Jak daleko seznam odsadit zleva \u2014 1.5em, 24px."],"Indent":["Odsazen\u00ed"],"Lettered":["P\u00edsmena"],"Mark colour":["Barva odr\u00e1\u017eky"],"Marked with":["Odr\u00e1\u017eka"],"Space added between one item and the next.":["Mezera p\u0159idan\u00e1 mezi jednu polo\u017eku a dal\u0161\u00ed."],"\u2014 default \u2014":["\u2014 v\u00fdchoz\u00ed \u2014"],"A length with its unit \u2014 18px, 1.25rem \u2014 or empty to leave it to the theme.":["D\u00e9lka i s jednotkou \u2014 18px, 1.25rem \u2014 nebo pr\u00e1zdn\u00e9, a\u0165 rozhodne \u0161ablona."],"Font":["P\u00edsmo"],"Weight":["\u0158ez"],"Light (300)":["Tenk\u00e9 (300)"],"Regular (400)":["Z\u00e1kladn\u00ed (400)"],"Medium (500)":["St\u0159edn\u00ed (500)"],"Semibold (600)":["Polotu\u010dn\u00e9 (600)"],"Bold (700)":["Tu\u010dn\u00e9 (700)"],"Black (900)":["Extra tu\u010dn\u00e9 (900)"],"Style":["Sklon"],"Upright":["Stojat\u00e9"],"Italic":["Kurz\u00edva"],"Line height":["\u0158\u00e1dkov\u00e1n\u00ed"],"A number \u2014 1.4 \u2014 or a length.":["\u010c\u00edslo \u2014 1.4 \u2014 nebo d\u00e9lka."],"Letter spacing":["Prostrk\u00e1n\u00ed"],"A length, which may be negative.":["D\u00e9lka, klidn\u011b z\u00e1porn\u00e1."],"Capitals":["Velikost p\u00edsmen"],"As written":["Jak je naps\u00e1no"],"UPPERCASE":["VERZ\u00c1LKY"],"lowercase":["minusky"],"First Letters":["Prvn\u00ed P\u00edsmena"],"Decoration":["Zdoben\u00ed"],"Underline":["Podtr\u017een\u00ed"],"Struck through":["P\u0159e\u0161krtnut\u00ed"],"Alignment":["Zarovn\u00e1n\u00ed"],"Left":["Vlevo"],"Centre":["Na st\u0159ed"],"Right":["Vpravo"],"Justified":["Do bloku"],"Margin":["Okraj"],"Up to four lengths, the CSS way: \"0 0 4px 0\".":["A\u017e \u010dty\u0159i d\u00e9lky, jak je zvykem v CSS: \u201e0 0 4px 0\u201c."],"What this shows":["Co se zobrazuje"],"Left as it is, the block shows whichever course or trainer the page is about \u2014 which is what a template in a theme builder wants, and what makes one design serve them all.":["Kdy\u017e to nech\u00e1te b\u00fdt, blok uk\u00e1\u017ee ten kurz nebo toho tren\u00e9ra, o kter\u00e9m str\u00e1nka je \u2014 co\u017e je p\u0159esn\u011b to, co pot\u0159ebuje \u0161ablona v Theme Builderu, a d\u00edky \u010demu jeden design poslou\u017e\u00ed v\u0161em."],"Heading and layout":["Nadpis a rozvr\u017een\u00ed"],"Empty means \u201c%s\u201d.":["Pr\u00e1zdn\u00e9 znamen\u00e1 \u201e%s\u201c."],"What to call this field.":["Jak tohle pole pojmenovat."],"A colon, a dash \u2014 printed right after the heading. Useful side by side.":["Dvojte\u010dka, poml\u010dka \u2014 vyp\u00ed\u0161e se hned za nadpisem. Hod\u00ed se, kdy\u017e jsou vedle sebe."],"Value":["Hodnota"],"Left empty, the block disappears rather than printing a heading over a blank space.":["Kdy\u017e nech\u00e1te pr\u00e1zdn\u00e9, blok zmiz\u00ed, m\u00edsto aby tiskl nadpis nad pr\u00e1zdn\u00fdm m\u00edstem."],"Animation":["Animace"],"On first sight":["P\u0159i prvn\u00edm spat\u0159en\u00ed"],"Fade in":["Prolnut\u00ed"],"Rise":["Zdola"],"Fall":["Shora"],"From the left":["Zleva"],"From the right":["Zprava"],"Grow":["Zv\u011bt\u0161en\u00ed"],"Duration (ms)":["Trv\u00e1n\u00ed (ms)"],"Delay (ms)":["Zpo\u017ed\u011bn\u00ed (ms)"],"Animations run when the block first comes into view, and never for a visitor who has asked their computer to keep still.":["Animace se spust\u00ed, kdy\u017e se blok poprv\u00e9 objev\u00ed na obrazovce \u2014 a nikdy n\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvn\u00edkovi, kter\u00fd si vy\u017e\u00e1dal omezen\u00ed pohybu."],"Larger is not better: a portrait shown at 300 pixels costs the visitor nothing extra if 300 pixels is what is sent.":["V\u011bt\u0161\u00ed nen\u00ed lep\u0161\u00ed: portr\u00e9t zobrazen\u00fd na 300 pixelech nestoj\u00ed n\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvn\u00edka nic nav\u00edc, pokud se po\u0161le pr\u00e1v\u011b 300 pixel\u016f."],"Padding":["Vnit\u0159n\u00ed okraj"],"Up to four lengths, the CSS way: \"8px 12px\".":["A\u017e \u010dty\u0159i d\u00e9lky, jak je zvykem v CSS: \u201e8px 12px\u201c."],"Background":["Pozad\u00ed"],"Left alone, a link keeps the colour the theme gives it.":["Kdy\u017e to nech\u00e1te b\u00fdt, odkaz si nech\u00e1 barvu, kterou mu d\u00e1v\u00e1 \u0161ablona."],"Lines and banding":["\u010c\u00e1ry a pruhov\u00e1n\u00ed"],"Line thickness":["S\u00edla \u010d\u00e1ry"],"The rule under each row. A length \u2014 1px, 2px.":["\u010c\u00e1ra pod ka\u017ed\u00fdm \u0159\u00e1dkem. D\u00e9lka \u2014 1px, 2px."],"Line colour":["Barva \u010d\u00e1ry"],"Every other row":["Ka\u017ed\u00fd druh\u00fd \u0159\u00e1dek"],"A colour here bands the table: every second row takes it.":["Barva tady tabulku pruhuje: vezme si ji ka\u017ed\u00fd druh\u00fd \u0159\u00e1dek."],"Width of %s":["\u0160\u00ed\u0159ka sloupce %s"],"Alignment of %s":["Zarovn\u00e1n\u00ed sloupce %s"],"A length or a percentage. Empty lets the table decide.":["D\u00e9lka nebo procenta. Pr\u00e1zdn\u00e9 nech\u00e1 rozhodnout tabulku."],"Photograph ratio":["Pom\u011br stran fotografie"],"Width divided by height \u2014 \"1\/1\" for a square, \"4\/3\" or \"3\/4\" for a portrait. Empty leaves it its natural shape.":["\u0160\u00ed\u0159ka d\u011blen\u00e1 v\u00fd\u0161kou \u2014 \u201e1\/1\u201c pro \u010dtverec, \u201e4\/3\u201c nebo \u201e3\/4\u201c pro portr\u00e9t. Pr\u00e1zdn\u00e9 ponech\u00e1 p\u0159irozen\u00fd tvar."],"Photograph margin":["Okraj fotografie"],"Row":["\u0158\u00e1dek"],"Cards":["Karty"],"Which column":[""],"Arrangement":[""],"Photo & name arrangement":[""],"Space between one card and the next. A length \u2014 1rem, 16px.":[""],"Photograph size":["Velikost fotografie"],"Up to four lengths, the CSS way: \"0 0 8px 0\".":[""],"Columns \u2014 drag to reorder. Present here, they decide the table; empty, the numbered settings above still do.":[""],"Heading above":[""],"Side by side":[""]}}}